 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Registration Programming Interface (Inria) - development files
 RPI (Registration Programming Interface) is an Inria header-only C++ API
 providing a common interface to image registration methods built on the
 Insight Toolkit (ITK). It is a build dependency of medInria.
 .
 This package provides the headers and CMake configuration (found via
 RPI_DIR); RPI ships no shared libraries.
